<FONT SIZE=6 COLOR="NAVY"><I><B>VM Power Leveling</B></I></FONT><BR>
<FONT SIZE=2 COLOR="NAVY"><I>Available to characters 46+ on all servers through the Stormhammer Legends program</I></FONT><BR><BR>

<FONT SIZE=4 COLOR=NAVY><I><B>Overview</B></I></FONT>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
This is a dutch auction for AA points priced at $12 each. I guarantee at least 50 AA per week if you are level 60 or 40 AA per week if you are level 65. I operate Monday to Friday, 8 to 10 hours per day. Customers are able to play their character in the evenings and on weekends without interfering with the power leveling.<BR><BR>
Please see my <a href="http://www.playerauctions.com/search/search_results.cfm?search_type=seller_search&search_name=Search+by+Seller&search_text=vmardian&order_by=bidcount&sort_order=DESC">other auctions</a> for levels 46 to 65.<BR><BR>
<I>Due to popular demand, there may be a waiting list for new orders. You will be guaranteed the next available spot once your payment or deposit has been received.</I>
</BLOCKQUOTE>

<FONT SIZE=4 COLOR=NAVY><I><B>About</B></I></FONT>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
VM Power Leveling is the longest-running and most trusted Stormhammer-based power leveling service. To date I have power leveled over 4800 AA points, 600 planar levels, and over 50 PoV/PoS flaggings. My feedback rating on Player Auctions is the highest for any strict Stormhammer-based power leveling service. Every single customer has been extremely satisfied with my service to the extent that more than half of first time customers become returning customers.<BR><BR>

