<FONT SIZE=4 COLOR=NAVY><I><B>How It Works</B></I></FONT>

<DIR>
<LI>Place an order through Player Auctions 
<LI>Email me through Player Auctions with the details of your order
<LI>Transfer to Stormhammer for 30 days
<LI>Send payment through Paypal, Western Union, or letter mail 
<LI>Send account information for power leveling to commence 
<LI>Receive daily updates on the progress of your character 
</DIR>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
Experience is earned in the normal fashion of killing monsters and not by any other means such as repeating quests or exploiting bugs. Your character will not sit AFK off to the side. Your character will be used in combat and the appropriate spell casting or weapon skills will be kept up to speed.
</BLOCKQUOTE>

